Step 1: Install Swiper
npm install swiper
Step 2: Import Swiper
import { Swiper, SwiperSlide } from "swiper/react";
import { Autoplay } from "swiper/modules";

import "swiper/css";
Step 3: Create your sports array
const SPORTS = [
  {
    name: "Cricket",
    image: "/sports/cricket.jpg",
  },
  {
    name: "Football",
    image: "/sports/football.jpg",
  },
  {
    name: "Basketball",
    image: "/sports/basketball.jpg",
  },
  {
    name: "Volleyball",
    image: "/sports/volleyball.jpg",
  },
  {
    name: "Kabaddi",
    image: "/sports/kabaddi.jpg",
  },
  {
    name: "Futsal",
    image: "/sports/futsal.jpg",
  },
];

Put these images inside:

public/
└── sports/
    ├── cricket.jpg
    ├── football.jpg
    ├── basketball.jpg
    ├── volleyball.jpg
    ├── kabaddi.jpg
    └── futsal.jpg
Step 4: Replace your grid with a slider
<section className="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 bg-muted/30">
  <div className="mx-auto max-w-7xl">

    <div className="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 className="text-4xl font-bold">
        Explore Sports
      </h2>

      <p className="text-muted-foreground mt-2">
        From cricket to kabaddi — find your game
      </p>
    </div>

    <Swiper
      modules={[Autoplay]}
      autoplay={{
        delay: 2500,
        disableOnInteraction: false,
      }}
      loop
      spaceBetween={20}
      breakpoints={{
        320: {
          slidesPerView: 1.3,
        },
        640: {
          slidesPerView: 2,
        },
        768: {
          slidesPerView: 3,
        },
        1024: {
          slidesPerView: 4,
        },
        1280: {
          slidesPerView: 5,
        },
      }}
    >
      {SPORTS.map((sport) => (
        <SwiperSlide key={sport.name}>
          <Link
            to={`/find-teams?sport=${sport.name.toLowerCase()}`}
            className="group block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg"
          >
            <img
              src={sport.image}
              alt={sport.name}
              className="h-72 w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"
            />

            <div className="bg-black/60 p-4 text-center">
              <h3 className="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                {sport.name}
              </h3>
            </div>
          </Link>
        </SwiperSlide>
      ))}
    </Swiper>

  </div>
</section>



